{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>受困韓國釜山人工水道鯊魚解困後折返　疑不適應船隻噪音返回水道</strong></p><p>・鯊魚受困韓國人工水道<br>・解困後折返回到水道<br>・疑因不適應船隻噪音<br>・事件涉及人鯊衝突及安置</p><p>暫時未能從TVB 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202140-受困韓國釜山人工水道鯊魚解困後折返疑不適應船隻噪音返回水道\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:48.668690+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:57:51.114701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.246562+00:00","content_hash":"9c9e500460b975fdae7e9a372c90761824b32bca58a42ae7107e5032996ff040","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}